45297::$$$message_0414_0000_0000$$$::"Waaah! Now we've gone and done it! We can't go home anymore!"::
45298::$$$message_0414_0000_0001$$$::"Calm down, Illya. I think they really are different people."::
45299::$$$message_0414_0000_0002$$$::"I feel like she's Mama, but not Mama. I wonder if we've been sucked into some weird dimension again."::

